{"resourceIdentifier":"3049","resourceName":"Rio Preto Grouped REDD+ Project","description":"The primary objective of the Rio Preto REDD+ Project is to avoid the unplanned deforestation (AUD) of the 2,295 ha project area, consisting 100% of Amazon rainforest. The project area is located within 2 private properties in Nova Marilândia and Santo Afonso municipalities, in the State of Mato Grosso. The present REDD project is expected to avoid a predicted 344.74 ha of deforestation, equating to 87,739 tCO2e in emissions reductions over the 30-year project lifetime (29-May-2019 to 28-May-2049), with an annual average of 2,925 tCO2e. Beyond the project’s ecological and carbon benefits, a proportion of the carbon credits generated will be dedicated to improving the social and environmental conditions in the project region, specifically contributing to improving deforestation control, and developing environmental education and other social activities.","location":{"latitude":-14.368885,"longitude":-57.189000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-06-03","endExclusive":"2022-07-04","endInclusive":"2022-07-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3049"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mato Grosso"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Future Climate Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Grand Cayman, Cayman Islands"},{"type":"string","value":"+55 11 3045-3474"},{"type":"string","value":"registry@futureclimate.com"},{"type":"string","value":"https://futureclimate.com/"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2925"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{